    LLM: "Play follows fishing game mechanics with unique 'Cau' calls. Players capture by matching ranks or forming sequences. Sequences wrap: 10 follows 7, and 1 follows 12 (e.g., 5-6-7-10-11 and 11-12-1-2-3 are valid). Special rules for 'Cau' calls and table cleaning. Game involves payments in cards for certain calls and cleaning the table.",
    Player: "Play follows fishing game mechanics with unique 'Cau' calls. Players capture by matching ranks or forming sequences. Sequences wrap: 10 follows 7, and 1 follows 12 (e.g., 5-6-7-10-11 and 11-12-1-2-3 are valid). Special rules for 'Cau' calls and table cleaning. Game involves payments in cards for certain calls and cleaning the table.",
    objective: 'The aim is to take more cards than your opponents. Players capture cards by matching ranks or by taking unbroken ascending sequences (10 follows 7, 1 follows 12). The player with the most cards at the end of the hand wins that hand; the first to win an agreed number of hands wins the game.',
